Package: dragonpbx-ui
Version: __VERSION__
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Installed-Size: __INSTALLED_SIZE__
Maintainer: DragonPBX <support@dragonpbx.local>
Depends: adduser, libc6, libstdc++6, libgcc-s1, ca-certificates, nginx
Recommends: dragonpbx, certbot, python3-certbot-nginx
Description: DragonPBX web UI / configuration API (Sails)
 The DragonPBX admin web UI and configuration API — a Sails.js app bundled with
 a self-contained Node.js runtime. Serves the domain/trunk configuration that the
 DragonPBX call-control app consumes (default port 1337). Designed to run on the
 same host as the dragonpbx package; uses a local on-disk datastore under
 /var/lib/dragonpbx-ui and (optionally) the host's redis for sessions.
